  "limitations": [
    "ac2dm token presence before and after invalidation is not an independently observed network refresh or a third-party Google Sign-In test.",
    "No Play Store login/download, Maps, fused location, FCM delivery, Play Integrity, banking app or corpus acceptance test was completed.",
    "Phenotype, Ads and Measurement results are broker handshakes, not completed functional APIs; App Set ID refused binding before an API call.",
    "Baseline did not reproduce service error 9, so these probes cannot measure removal of that restriction.",
    "Gservices events are provider writes, not independently captured Google policy responses; uncertified_status=1 does not by itself establish manual-registration status.",
    "The probe and service processes used one native host UID; this experiment does not validate production app isolation, access control or GrapheneOS security parity.",
    "WebView and some firmware inputs were device-captured; full source closure was not established.",
    "Preliminary runs without secondary-process launch wiring or without the Bionic shim are excluded from the comparison.",
    "Bounded launch/restart checks are not a long-duration stability or performance test.",
    "Login was driven through private diagnostic input; physical keyboard and gesture acceptance was not tested."
  ]
